From 45c8475f4c5455461c214a72c4052c43660df13f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felucca dev <dev@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 14:53:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Eight sequences per track (FELUCCA_PATBANK), with MENU >
 CONTROL > SEQ SWITCH

Each track plays one of eight sequences (own steps, LEN, 64 automation records).
SEQ > SEQUENCE (fourth SEQ page); SEQ held + C5..G5; MENU > CONTROL > SEQ SWITCH
NOW / END (the knob steps from the sequence that waits). Project SAVE/LOAD and
the autosave keep them in the flash the user sample slots had (builds without
FELUCCA_PATBANK keep USR1..3). Version string v1.5.1_sequences. Based on 1.5.1.
